ife imprisonment on Friday for rape and 162 years for 24 other counts he faced, the National Prosecuting Authority (NPA) has said. <br><br><span class=\"headin\">Hidden Camera:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Graphics:</span> No<br></div><div class=\"col-sm-3\"><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Accept / Reject</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"headin\">Status:</span> <span class=\"app\">Approved</span><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Proposal Date:</span> Thursday, 25 July 2019<br><span class=\"headin\">Approved By:</span> Anna-Maria van Niekerk<br><span class=\"headin\">Approval Date:</span> 25 July 2019<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Commission</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\"><span class=\"headin\">Commission Number:</span> 5500<br><span class=\"headin\">Duration:</span> 2<br><span class=\"headin\">Delivery Date:</span> Thursday, 25 July 2019<br><span class=\"headin\">Accept Contract:</span> I agree with the following <a href=\"cap-contractual-agreement/72213\">CAP Contractual Agreement</a><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal Viewing:</span> No<br><span class=\"headin\">Accepted By:</span> Nikola Vrahimis<br><span class=\"headin\">Accepted Date:</span> 01 August 2019<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Broadcast / Delivery</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\"><span class=\"headin\">Broadcast:</span> MOD<br><span class=\"headin\">Approved for Broadcast by Editor:</span> Yes, t