td>\n                                                                <td>4</td>\n                                                                <td>00:26:00</td>\n                                                                <td>Audio Network</td>\n                                                                <td>Terry Devine King</td>\n                                                                <td>ANW1874</td>\n                                                                </tr></tbody>\n                                                            </table></div><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><br><h3>TX Details</h3><br><h4>Back references from Insert in Show:</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"table table-hover table-responsive\" id=\"backref-tbl\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Title</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Author</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Last Updated</th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr class=\"table-primary\"><td><a href=\"show-view/72210\">28 July 2019 - Carte Blanche HD</a></td><td><a href=\"user-view/135\">nombuso@carteblanche.co.za</a></td><td data-sort=\"\">01 August 2019</td></tr></tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table><h4>Press Release:</h4><br>No press release published.<br><br><h4>Script:</h4><br>UPDATE: Dawie De Villiers Sentencing SCRIPT …<br>\n<br>\nUPSOUND Judge Moosa: “Mr de Villiers please stand…in respect of count three you are sentenced to life imprisonment”<br>\n<br>\nVO: Finally after a protracted four year court battle… Dawie De Villiers… the sex offender, who had lured in girls and young women while pretending to be an accomplished Modelling agency boss, would spend a lifetime in prison for rape… but Acting Judge Cassim Moosa of the South Gauteng High Court, wasn’t done with him yet… <br>\n<br>\nUPSOUND Judge Moosa: “Count number four.. sexual assault… 8 years imprisonment… count number six sexual assault… sentenced to eight years imprisonment… sexual grooming of a child … eight years imprisonment…count 7 – sexual assault … sentenced to ten years imprisonment”<br>\n<br>\nVO: In 2013, Carte Blanche exposed De Villiers. One of his victims told how he targeted girls as young as 15, promising them lucrative modelling contracts before sexually assaulting them… <br>\n<br>\nUPSOUND old story: [Carte Blanche 14 April 2013] 'Bronwen' (Model): Then he started pulling my panties off… he told me to lie on the bed and put his arm around me while I was naked…\"<br>\n<br>\nVO: De Villiers was finally arrested and appeared in court for the first time in 2015, but he pleaded not guilty. Then in December 2016 the Court found him guilty of a number of charges which included the accessing of child pornography, the sexual grooming of a child, sexual assault, rape and fraud… Earlier this month, his moment of reckoning had finally arrived… <br>\n<br>\nUPSOUND: 01:42:19 Judge Moosa “Considering that the prescribed minimum sentence for the rape in count 3 all determinant  … all will run concurrently with the sentence of life imprisonment..” <br>\n<br>\nVO: De Villiers has instructed his lawyers to apply for leave to appeal sentencing… <br>\n<br></div></div></div>\t\n\t</div>    \n</div><script language=\"JavaScript\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"assets/js/bootstrap.min.js\"></script>\n<script language=\"JavaScript\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"assets/js/fontawesome-all.js\"></script>\n<script language=\"JavaScript\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://code.jquery.com/ui/1.13.1/jquery-ui.js\"></script>\n<script language=\"JavaScript\" type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"assets/js/scripts.min.js\"></script>\n\n</div>",
